concept :the_seam_pass do
  name "The Seam Pass"
  tags :legibility, :surveillance, :resistance
  prominence :marginal

  prose <<~PROSE
    A barrier is certified by challenging the working barrier where it stands. Whatever the barrier exists to stop is put against it, in place, and the far side is then traced along every join at a walking pace the procedure fixes. The barrier passes if no single join lets through more than the stated fraction.

    An average across the whole barrier certifies nothing. The fraction is local, so one place that leaks is a failure whatever the rest of the surface does. Both the #{ref :the_gatekeepers, "Gatekeepers"} and the #{ref :the_choir, "Choir"} run their barriers this way, and both took the shape of the procedure from an industrial standard older than either government: the method for testing an air filter without lifting it out of its frame, whose finding was that the medium holds and the frame leaks.
  PROSE

  prose <<~PROSE, section: :mechanics, heading: "The Ordinary Challenger"
    The party running the challenge must be no better equipped and no better informed than the party actually feared. A challenge run by the strongest available adversary fails everything and leaves a card that cannot distinguish a barrier needing work from one that does not.

    So a Gatekeeper bed is challenged against a neighbourhood hedge rather than against a trunk network, and the Choir hands a quarter of #{ref :caretaker, "Caretaker"}'s published district returns to #{ref :dequindre, "Dequindre"}, which is worse at nearly everything than the model it stands in for and was built to answer an adjacent question. The card names who traced, what was traced in place, the largest local figure found, and the month the next trace falls due.
  PROSE

  prose <<~PROSE, section: :operations, heading: "Two Seams"
    The Gatekeepers kept the standard's own unit, one part in ten thousand, and their joins are physical: a stand's foot, a barrow tray, a carrier's cuffs, a cell drain. #{ref :xincheng_yard, "The Xincheng yard"} traces eight beds at a time and breaks every bed it has challenged.

    The Choir's local figure is one household. A challenger given a quarter's returns fails that quarter if it names a single address correctly, whatever else it gets wrong. The Choir's joins are its teachers: a #{ref :the_held_line, "line"} is taught by one member to one member, so the only person who can know that two lines carry the same purchase entry in the same week is the person who taught both of them.
  PROSE

  prose <<~PROSE, section: :limits, heading: "What Is Not On The Card"
    A trace covers the joins somebody thought of. The #{ref :xincheng_yard, "Xincheng"} cards for 2088 list four joins and the cards for 2074 list two; the later pair went onto the form after failures nobody had been tracing for.

    The #{ref :the_preservationists, "Preservationists"} decline to accept a challenge card in place of a lineage record, on the ground that a challenge is something a party pays to have declared sound. Their couriers pay the scraping-read surcharge that the refusal costs them at every crossing.
  PROSE

  log "2026-08-09 — In-place HEPA filter integrity testing decides the whole shape: the acceptance criterion is a *local* penetration of no more than 0.01 per cent of the upstream challenge, found by scanning downstream at a fixed traverse speed, and the scan is run along the frame and the mounting-grid gasket because bypass at the seal dominates penetration through the medium. Borrowed: local rather than average limit, the trace along joins at a stated pace, the one-part-in-ten-thousand unit, and the card that names the next due date. Reason: two traditions with no contact count in the same unit because both inherited one standard for testing a barrier without taking it out of service."
  log "2026-08-09 — Intruder testing in statistical disclosure control decides the challenger rule: the tester is a friendly intruder with background knowledge like an ordinary user's, chosen to replicate an opportunistic attacker rather than a well-equipped professional. That is why the Choir uses a feral model that is worse than the model it stands in for, and why using the best available adversary is treated as a procedural error rather than as thoroughness."
end
